    "description": "Collectibles! Mineral Specimen Assorted Rock ,Stone, Geode, Agate Quartz Lot!\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nColor\n: Multicolor\nMaterial\n: Rock, mineral, stone\nCategory\n: Collectibles\nCondition\n: Good: Minor visible imperfections\nDescription\n: Explore this captivating mixed lot of 40+ collectible minerals, crystals, and geodes. This unique assortment includes rough stones, sparkling quartz and amethyst geodes, sliced agate specimens, and various vividly colored mineral samples. Each piece displays distinct textures, natural patterns, and rich hues, ranging from vibrant reds and deep purples to subtle greens, blues, and neutrals. The geode specimens feature shimmering crystal interiors and the agate slices showcase striking banded patterns, making them perfect for display or educational use.\nIdeal for collectors, hobbyists, educators, or anyone fascinated by Earth's natural wonders, these specimens provide both visual appeal and hands-on learning opportunities. Their varied forms and colors enhance any shelf, desk, or classroom set-up, and their natural formation ensures no two are the same.\nAll items are in visibly good, unmounted condition, as shown in the images. This lot offers an excellent and broad introduction to the beauty and diversity of mineral collecting. See all photos for exact items and condition\nUSED ITEMS DISCLAIMER:\nPlease note that all items have been donated. All items are used and untested (including battery life & functionality), lots are unsorted, unless otherwise noted. We do our best to ensure the quality of all our auctions & describe them accurately; however, we are not experts in any field. Items may contain unseen flaws or unknown missing parts not noted in the description.\nAll items are sold AS IS.\nIf you need further information about an item, please contact us prior to the close of the auction.\nTERMS OF SALE:\nOrders must be paid for within seven (7) days from the close of auction. All orders not